   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   WARNING: This file is INTENTIONALLY MALFORMED for parser-robustness
   testing. Do NOT use as exchange data.
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Defect
     Stretching a face by an extreme GTrsf (large diagonal-element
     scaling factor) throws Standard_ConstructionError rather than
     returning failure. Trigger reproduces in OCCT #872.
   Reproducer recipe
     CARTESIAN_TRANSFORMATION_OPERATOR_3D with diagonal scale factors
     1e+18, 1e+18, 1e+18 applied via ITEM_DEFINED_TRANSFORMATION to a
     simple plane reference. Reading and applying the transform throws
     across the ABI boundary.
   Expected kernel behavior
     Heal (clamp scale to safe magnitude with warning) or return error
     code; do not throw across ABI boundary. Emit E_GTRSF_OUT_OF_RANGE.
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*/
